expression: stdout
---
Save a passage from an item as a highlight

Usage: mxr reading highlight [OPTIONS] <ITEM> <QUOTE>

Arguments:
  <ITEM>
  <QUOTE>

Options:
      --note <NOTE>
      --article            Taken from the fetched article rather than the issue
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
